## 1. 學生相關 API

### 1.1 獲取學生資料
`GET /students/me`

**回應範例**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "student_001",
    "name": "王哈哈",
    "gradeYear": "高二",
    "email": "student001@example.com",
    "phone": "0912-345-678",
    "subjects": [
      {
        "subjectId": "subject_bio",
        "subjectName": "生物",
        "classId": "class_hs2_bio_01",
        "className": "高二生物班"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

### 1.2 更新學生資料
`PUT /students/me`

**請求 Body**
```json
{
  "name": "王哈哈",
  "phone": "0912-345-678",
  "email": "student001@example.com"
}
```

