## 2. 科目與課程 API

### 2.1 獲取科目列表
`GET /subjects`

**回應範例**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    { "id": "subject_bio", "name": "生物" },
    { "id": "subject_math", "name": "數學" }
  ]
}
```

### 2.2 獲取單元列表
`GET /units?subjectId=subject_bio`

**查詢參數**
| 參數 | 類型 | 必填 | 說明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| subjectId | string | 是 | 科目 ID |

**回應範例**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "unit_bio_01",
      "name": "單元一 人體的運輸與防禦",
      "order": 1,
      "subUnits": [
        {
          "id": "subunit_bio_01_01",
          "name": "1-1 血液循環概述",
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "subunit_bio_01_02",
          "name": "1-2 體循環與肺循環",
          "order": 2
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### 2.3 獲取概念列表
`GET /concepts?unitId=unit_bio_02`

**查詢參數**
| 參數 | 類型 | 必填 | 說明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| unitId | string | 否 | 單元 ID |
| subjectId | string | 否 | 科目 ID |

**回應範例**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "concept_bio_003",
      "name": "氣體交換",
      "unitId": "unit_bio_02",
      "subjectId": "subject_bio",
      "mistakeCount": 5,
      "keywords": ["肺泡", "氧氣", "二氧化碳"]
    }
  ]
}
```

